@Bff = http://localhost:5030
@userCode = cole-aqui-um-codigo-de-usuario
@teamCode = cole-aqui-um-codigo-de-equipe
@rootCode = cole-aqui-o-codigo-do-problema
@linkCode = cole-aqui-o-codigo-de-um-no
@hypothesisCode = cole-aqui-o-codigo-de-uma-hipotese

### Saude do BFF e dos 5 microsservicos
GET {{Bff}}/bff/health

### Usuarios
POST {{Bff}}/bff/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Souza", "email": "ana@satc.edu.br" }

###
GET {{Bff}}/bff/users?name=ana

### Equipe (membros ja voltam com nome e e-mail)
POST {{Bff}}/bff/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Equipe Refeitorio",
  "description": "Projeto de ES",
  "members": [ { "userCode": "{{userCode}}", "role": "owner" } ]
}

###
GET {{Bff}}/bff/teams/{{teamCode}}

### Adiciona (ou troca o papel de) um membro
POST {{Bff}}/bff/teams/{{teamCode}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userCode": "{{userCode}}", "role": "Collaborator" }

### Cria o problema raiz (devolve a arvore)
POST {{Bff}}/bff/ideas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Reduzir o desperdicio no refeitorio",
  "description": "## De onde vem o problema\nEstudantes deixam comida no prato.",
  "autorCode": "{{userCode}}",
  "teamCode": "{{teamCode}}"
}

### Arvore completa (aceita o codigo de qualquer no)
GET {{Bff}}/bff/ideas/{{rootCode}}/tree?includeDiscarded=true

### Propoe uma solucao/versao (type opcional: inferido pelo pai)
POST {{Bff}}/bff/links/{{rootCode}}/children
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Aplicativo de reserva de refeicoes",
  "reason": "Permite saber a demanda antes",
  "autorCode": "{{userCode}}"
}

### Painel do no
GET {{Bff}}/bff/links/{{linkCode}}

### Seleciona o no (irmaos viram descartados)
PUT {{Bff}}/bff/links/{{linkCode}}/select
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Melhor custo-beneficio" }

### Hipotese
POST {{Bff}}/bff/links/{{linkCode}}/hypotheses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Reservas reduzem sobras", "successCriteria": "Sobras caem 20% em 2 semanas" }

### Resultado da hipotese (validated | refuted)
PUT {{Bff}}/bff/hypotheses/{{hypothesisCode}}/result
Content-Type: application/json

{ "result": "validated" }

### Feedback (so em no aberto; 409 caso contrario)
POST {{Bff}}/bff/links/{{rootCode}}/feedbacks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "autorCode": "{{userCode}}", "text": "Problema muito relevante", "rating": 5 }

### Exportacao: dados agregados
GET {{Bff}}/bff/export/{{rootCode}}?scope=full&includeHistory=true

### Exportacao: Markdown no perfil "tickets"
GET {{Bff}}/bff/export/{{rootCode}}?format=markdown&profile=tickets

### Exportacao: so o caminho selecionado em Mermaid
GET {{Bff}}/bff/export/{{rootCode}}?scope=selected&format=mermaid

### Exportacao: CSV para download
GET {{Bff}}/bff/export/{{rootCode}}?format=csv&download=true

### Perfis de vocabulario
GET {{Bff}}/bff/export/profiles
